prerequest
---
1. router pkl (best_router_adapter  best_router.pkl)
2. litellm config(litellm.yaml)
3. semantic router config(semantic_router.yaml)

deploy
---

1. start litellm
---
`litellm –config litellm.yaml`

2. start grpo LLMRouter router endpoint
---
`python3 -m LLMRouter.scripts.start_endpoint --router best_router.pkl`

3. start rl-driven semantic router 
---
`vllm-sr serve --config semantic_router.yaml`


test
---
```
curl -s http://localhost:8899/v1/chat/completions \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "model": "MoM",
    "messages": [
      {
        "role": "user",
        "content": [{"type": "input_text", "text": "1+1=?"}]
      }
    ]
  }'
```
